    {
      "title": "Module 3: Likes and Dislikes",
      "subtopics": [
        {
          "title": "3.1 I Like / I Don't Like",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "title": "Expressing Food Preferences",
              "weight": 5,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700004005000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"zA2bB3cC4d\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In English, we use <b>like</b> to say what we enjoy. After <em>like</em>, use a noun or <em>verb + -ing</em>:\"}},{\"id\":\"dD5eE6fF7g\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>I like</b> apples. ✓\",\"<b>I like</b> eating pizza. ✓\",\"<b>I don't like</b> onions. ✓\"]}},{\"id\":\"gG8hH9iI0j\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Structure:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"jJ1kK2lL3m\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"I like / I don't like + food noun\",\"She likes / She doesn't like + food noun\",\"He likes fish. / He doesn't like vegetables.\"]}},{\"id\":\"mM4nN5oO6p\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"To ask: <b>Do you like ...?</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"pP7qQ8rR9s\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"Do you like coffee? — Yes, I do. / No, I don't.\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "Do you like pizza? Yes, I do! I love it.",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "order": 3,
                  "type": "sentence-task",
                  "tasks": [
                    {
                      "sentence": "I ___ pizza.",
                      "answers": [
                        "like",
                        "likes",
                        "am"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "sentence": "She ___ vegetables.",
                      "answers": [
                        "likes",
                        "like",
                        "is"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "sentence": "They ___ not like fish.",
                      "answers": [
                        "do",
                        "does",
                        "are"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "order": 4,
                  "type": "fill-gaps",
                  "text": "A: Do you [like] pasta? B: Yes, I [do]! I love it. Do you like vegetables? A: I [don't] like onions, but I like [carrots].",
                  "gaps": [
                    {
                      "placeholder": "like",
                      "answers": [
                        "like"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "placeholder": "do",
                      "answers": [
                        "do"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "placeholder": "don't",
                      "answers": [
                        "don't",
                        "do not"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "placeholder": "carrots",
                      "answers": [
                        "carrots"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "order": 5,
                  "type": "test",
                  "questions": [
                    {
                      "text": "Which sentence is correct?",
                      "options": [
                        "I like eat pizza.",
                        "I like pizza.",
                        "I am like pizza.",
                        "I likes pizza."
                      ],
                      "correctOptions": [
                        1
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Complete: She ___ vegetables. (positive for she/he)",
                      "options": [
                        "like",
                        "likes",
                        "liking",
                        "liked"
                      ],
                      "correctOptions": [
                        1
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Love, Like, Don't Like, Hate",
              "weight": 6,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700004006000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"sS0tT1uU2v\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We can express different levels of preference:\"}},{\"id\":\"vV3wW4xX5y\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>I love</b> chocolate! (very strong like)\",\"<b>I like</b> salad. ✓ (positive)\",\"<b>I don't mind</b> fish. (neutral — it's okay)\",\"<b>I don't like</b> garlic. ✗ (negative)\",\"<b>I hate</b> spicy food! (very strong dislike)\"]}},{\"id\":\"yY6zZ7aA8b\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"To ask: <b>How do you like ...?</b> or <b>What do you think of ...?</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"bB9cC0dD1e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Example: <em>I <b>love</b> pasta, but I <b>hate</b> raw onions.</em>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "I love chocolate! But I hate spicy food.",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "order": 3,
                  "type": "translation",
                  "pairs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1700004006001",
                      "english": "I love chocolate.",
                      "russian": "Я обожаю шоколад.",
